        <section id="what-is-meant-by-the-term-collection" >
          
            <h2>What is meant by the term collection</h2>
              <p>In programming, a collection represents a set of similar data type items in a single unit and these are used for grouping and managing related objects. This grouping of data items will have some shared significance to the problem being solved that need to be worked upon together. The data items will be of the same type or in the same languages.</p>
<p>A collection has an underlying structure that is used for efficient data manipulation and storage. When collections are used in logical constructs this can help with code readability and maintenance. Examples of collections are linked lists, stacks, queues or dictionaries.</p>
<p>In Python, dictionaries are an example of a type of collection:</p>

              
              <div class="c-code"><pre class="language-python"><code class="language-python"><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token comment"># A dictionary is an example of a type of a collection in Python</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line">MyDictionary <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">  <span class="token string">"Product"</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token string">"iPhone"</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">"Flatscreen LCD"</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">"Galaxy S6"</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">"PS5"</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">  <span class="token string">"Manufacturer"</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token string">"Apple"</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">"Sony"</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">"Samsung"</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">"PlayStation"</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">  <span class="token string">"Price"</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token number">800.00</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token number">450.00</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token number">600.00</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token number">250.00</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token keyword">print</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>MyDictionary<span class="token punctuation">)</span></span></code></pre>
</div>

            
          
